<title>SWITZERLAND: TENNIS-SWISS OPEN FINAL RESULT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SWISS OPEN FINAL RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>GSTAAD, Switzerland 1997-07-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result in the final of the Swiss Open men's tennis tournament on Sunday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>6-Felix Mantilla (Spain) beat Juan Albert Viloca (Spain) 6-1 6-4 6-4</p>
</text>
